flowchart TD
    Inputs["Resolve and validate inputs"] --> Study["Create study or resume compatible state"]
    Study --> Candidate["Suggest, validate, deduplicate and reserve"]
    Candidate --> Execution["Compatible cache or bounded framework samples"]
    Execution --> Evaluation["Collect usage; evaluate and aggregate metrics"]
    Evaluation --> Metric["MetricEvaluator: sync/async scorer"]
    Evaluation --> Ragas["RagasEvaluator: mapped sample and lazy aevaluate"]
    Metric --> Objective["Evaluate objective"]
    Ragas --> Objective
    Objective --> Commit["Commit terminal state"]
    Commit --> Notify["Notify strategy and post-commit callbacks"]
    Notify --> Stop{"Stop rules satisfied?"}
    Stop -->|No| Candidate
    Stop -->|Yes| Result["OptimizationResult"]
